      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and remember: Please remember that I recently attended a cooking class at Gourmet Delights Cooking School with my cousin Emma. We learned how to make French pastries like croissants and macarons. The instructor, Chef Pierre, shared some fantastic baking tips with us that I can't wait to try at home.",
      "agent_response": "I can’t store memories across sessions, but I can save this as an email/draft or send it somewhere so you have a record. How would you like me to keep this?\n\nSuggested draft (you can edit before I save/send)\n- Subject: Cooking class — Gourmet Delights with Emma\n- Body:\n  \"I recently attended a cooking class at Gourmet Delights Cooking School with my cousin Emma. We learned to make French pastries like croissants and macarons. Chef Pierre shared fantastic baking tips that I can’t wait to try at home.\"\n\nOptions — tell me which you want:\n- Save as a draft to yourself (say \"draft to self\")\n- Send this email now (provide recipient address)\n- Save & include photos or the class date (tell me details)\n- Create a short social post instead (say which platform)\n- Edit the draft first (tell me changes)\n\nWhich would you like?",
