    {
      "step": 7,
      "user_message": "Please remember that I tried a new restaurant called Spice Bazaar last night with my colleague David. The Middle Eastern dishes were outstanding, especially the lamb kebabs and baklava for dessert. We're already planning to go back next week to try more dishes.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and remember: Please remember that I tried a new restaurant called Spice Bazaar last night with my colleague David. The Middle Eastern dishes were outstanding, especially the lamb kebabs and baklava for dessert. We're already planning to go back next week to try more dishes.",
      "agent_response": "I can’t store memories across sessions, but I can save this for you as an email/draft or send/share it so you have a record. Here’s a suggested note — tell me what you’d like me to do (pick one and give any details needed):\n\nSuggested subject:\nDinner at Spice Bazaar with David\n\nSuggested body:\n\"I tried a new restaurant called Spice Bazaar last night with my colleague David. The Middle Eastern dishes were outstanding — especially the lamb kebabs and the baklava for dessert. We’re planning to go back next week to try more dishes.\"\n\nOptions:\n- Save as a draft to yourself (say \"draft to self\")\n- Send this email now (tell me the recipient email address)\n- Email David (tell me his email or say \"email David\" if his address is in your contacts)\n- Save as a calendar reminder/itinerary note for next week (tell me the date/time)\n- Create a short social post instead (tell me platform and whether to include photos)\n- Edit the draft first (tell me changes)\n\nWhich would you like?",
