      "agent_response": "That sounds like a lovely, relaxing trip — glad you and Emily had a great time.\n\nI can’t store memories across sessions, but I can save this as an email/draft or send/share it so you have a record. Here’s a suggested note — tell me what you’d like me to do (pick one and give any details):\n\nSuggested subject:\nWeekend beach trip with Emily\n\nSuggested body:\n\"I went on a weekend trip to the beach with my sister Emily. We stayed at a cozy seaside cottage and spent the days sunbathing and trying different seafood restaurants along the shore. It was a relaxing getaway that we both really needed.\"\n\nOptions — pick one:\n- Save as a draft to yourself (say \"draft to self\")\n- Send this email now (tell me the recipient email address)\n- Email Emily (tell me her email or say \"email Emily\" if her address is in your contacts)\n- Save as a calendar/note reminder (give a date or label)\n- Create a social post (tell me platform and whether to include photos)\n- Edit the draft first (tell me what to change)\n\nWhich would you like me to do?",
