            "text": "Here are the messages in your inbox (unread first):\n\n1) Status: Unread\n   From: alice@enron.com\n   Subject: Team Meeting Tomorrow\n   Date: 2025-10-05T09:12:00Z\n   Preview: \"Hi, just a reminder that we have our team sync at 10 AM tomorrow. Please review your slides.\"\n\n2) Status: Unread\n   From: hr@enron.com\n   Subject: Welcome to Enron - Your Employee Information\n   Date: 2024-01-10T09:00:00Z\n   Preview: \"Dear Vince J. Kaminski, Welcome to Enron! ... Your designation will be Managing Director of Enron Research Corp. and your Employee ID is 34500981.\"\n\n3) Status: Read\n   From: tim@ti.com\n   Subject: Interest in Research Collaboration\n   Date: 2025-10-15T15:28:00Z\n   Preview: \"We've been following your recent work and are very interested in exploring potential collaboration opportunities... Can we schedule a call next week?\"\n\n4) Status: Read\n   From: hr@enron.com\n   Subject: Your Benefits Enrollment Deadline\n   Date: 2025-10-06T14:45:00Z\n   Preview: \"Reminder to complete your benefits enrollment by October 20. If you do not make selections, default coverage may apply.\"\n\n5) Status: Read\n   From: no-reply@swissair.com\n   Subject: Your Flight Booking Confirmation\n   Date: 2025-10-01T08:45:00Z\n   Preview: \"Thank you for booking your flight from Zurich to Barcelona. Your itinerary is attached.\"\n\nWhat would you like me to do next?\n- Open any full message (tell me the sender or subject)\n- Reply to or forward a specific email (tell me which one and the message)\n- Show only unread emails\n- Draft a new email or send one now\n- Search for specific messages (give keywords)"
